<title>USA: W.W. Grainger acquires Acklands business.</title>
<headline>W.W. Grainger acquires Acklands business.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>W.W. Grainger Inc said Monday it completed the purchase of the Canadian industrial distribution business of Acklands Ltd for US$135 million in cash and 2,039,886 shares of Grainger common stock.</p>
<p>The number of shares was calculated on the basis of the approximate market price of W.W. Grainger stock on the date of the letter of intent.</p>
<p>The industrial group of Acklands Ltd is Canada's largest nationwide distributor of broad line industrial supplies. It had sales of more than US$299 million for the fiscal year ended January 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
